Give be-lua's runtime the std/net functions Kotlin's Lua calls: sendRequest gives a broken promise, and the getters fail.
Upstream: not yet; to offer Kotlin Temper (Kotlin's Lua calls temper.sendrequest, which its runtime lacks).

Lua can't send requests yet, so a request gives a broken promise, as
std/net says a backend that can't send gives; no response reaches the
getters.

